만6000명이 관람하며 그해 흥행 1위에 올랐다. 윤정희는 대종상 신인상을 탔다. “이번 기회를 계기로 앞으로는 내 목소리의 녹음으로 기어이 여우주연상을 따리라 하고 마음먹었답니다.” 윤정희는 1967년 한 해에만 ‘청춘극장’을 비롯해 30여편 영화에 주연으로 출연했다.","date":"2026-01-18T20:00:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/culture-life/culture_general/2026/01/19/ZVLP3D6DSNB5XCJILLY76XHWVI/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"문화/라이프","categories":["culture"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/culture-life/?outputType=xml"},"title":"제1회 오탁번문학상에 시인 심재휘","partialText":"","date":"2026-01-16T13:31:23.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/culture-life/culture_general/2026/01/16/S67HPDM7ZBHXDLALQCCYSNGZUE/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"문화/라이프","categories":["culture"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/culture-life/?outputType=xml"},"title":"무대 위 220명… 영화가 공연장으로 들어왔다","partialText":"","date":"2026-01-18T15:40:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/culture-life/culture_general/2026/01/19/ZW4Q32WIKRCWJKXGHV2WRCP67Q/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"문화/라이프","categories":["culture"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/culture-life/?outputType=xml"},"title":"한국 문학 비평 한자리에","partialText":"","date":"2026-01-18T15:40:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/culture-life/culture_general/2026/01/19/BRTUJGGQQRGLXM4GCEJEPY4E5A/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"문화/라이프","categories":["culture"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/culture-life/?outputType=xml"},"title":"‘빚투’ 마이크로닷, 오디션으로 복귀… “난 부모가 발목 잡아”","partialText":"","date":"2026-01-16T11:13:28.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/culture-life/culture_general/2026/01/16/A2VJO3LF4BHSHN4UFA5QLC7QLU/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보",